@startuml
!theme plain
actor "Institution Administrator" as Admin
participant "Unified Workspace" as UI
participant "Integration API" as API
queue Worker
database "Staging + Mappings" as DB
participant "Canvas / Moodle / OneRoster" as Source

Admin -> UI: Configure connection using secret reference
UI -> API: create/test connection
API -> Source: standards-based connectivity test
API -> DB: non-sensitive evidence
Admin -> UI: Request sync
UI -> API: sync type + direction
API -> Worker: durable integrations.sync job
Worker -> Source: retrieve source records
Source --> Worker: records + cursor
Worker -> DB: stage payload + checksum
Worker -> DB: map external IDs or flag needs_review
Worker -> DB: audit counts and result
note over Worker,DB
No silent destructive replacement.
Canonical writes require mapping policy.
end note
@enduml
